sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Proposed protected workspace lifecycle
  accDescr: Compute pins a reservation from the selected Sandbox. It waits for the same original to acknowledge signed release, then the Gateway verifies serving before accepting workspace messages.
  participant C as Compute
  participant S as Selected Sandbox
  participant G as Agent Gateway
  participant W as Workspace endpoint
  Note over C,G: Prepare (no workspace traffic)
  C->>S: Read original workspace binding
  S-->>C: Reserved endpoint and generation
  C->>G: Pin origin, CA, root and generation
  Note over C,W: Activate and connect
  C->>S: Recheck original after signed release
  alt Same original acknowledged
    S-->>C: Matching release acknowledgement
    C->>G: Enable after authenticated serving check
    G->>W: Connect with pinned TLS trust
    W-->>G: Prove the released generation
    Note over G,W: Accept messages after both checks
  else Held, missing or replaced original
    S-->>C: Pending or refused
    Note over C,G: Keep the new revision unavailable
  end
